WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:05.173 line:12% align:center size:92%
How to use the LogisX driver app.
About 4 minutes.

2
00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:10.211 line:12% align:center size:92%
Sign in with the username and
password dispatch gave you.

3
00:00:10.211 --> 00:00:13.511 line:12% align:center size:92%
Type your username.

4
00:00:13.511 --> 00:00:17.369 line:12% align:center size:92%
Then your password. It shows as dots.

5
00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:21.049 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap Sign In. Your loads open first.

6
00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:24.073 line:12% align:center size:92%
Can't sign in? Call dispatch.

7
00:00:24.169 --> 00:00:29.126 line:12% align:center size:92%
Your loads sit under three tabs:
Active, Pending and Historical.

8
00:00:29.127 --> 00:00:32.807 line:12% align:center size:92%
Active is the load you're running now.

9
00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:36.426 line:12% align:center size:92%
Pending holds new loads from dispatch.

10
00:00:36.426 --> 00:00:40.176 line:12% align:center size:92%
Historical lists the loads
you've finished.

11
00:00:40.268 --> 00:00:46.077 line:12% align:center size:92%
A new load shows its route and
its pickup and delivery dates.

12
00:00:46.077 --> 00:00:51.884 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap Accept to take it,
or Decline if you can't run it.

13
00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:55.260 line:12% align:center size:92%
Once accepted, it moves to Active.

14
00:00:55.352 --> 00:01:02.010 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tapping a load opens its page,
with its number and status at the top.

15
00:01:02.011 --> 00:01:06.541 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap a section's title to open or close it.

16
00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:11.499 line:12% align:center size:92%
Pickup Details shows the shipper,
the address and your appointment.

17
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.179 line:12% align:center size:92%
Appointment times are the
facility's local time.

18
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:19.368 line:12% align:center size:92%
Drop-off Details shows where it delivers.

19
00:01:19.465 --> 00:01:25.274 line:12% align:center size:92%
This bar shows where the load is.
Right now it's In Transit.

20
00:01:25.274 --> 00:01:32.784 line:12% align:center size:92%
The ELD, the black box in your truck,
moves the status by itself at each stop.

21
00:01:32.784 --> 00:01:37.316 line:12% align:center size:92%
Your phone doesn't track the truck.
The ELD does.

22
00:01:37.316 --> 00:01:43.125 line:12% align:center size:92%
If a stop is missed, use the button.
It's only a backup.

23
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:47.112 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap it, then Confirm.

24
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:53.532 line:12% align:center size:92%
Delivered is the one step that needs you:
upload your POD first.

25
00:01:53.628 --> 00:01:57.739 line:12% align:center size:92%
Open Documents to add your paperwork.

26
00:01:57.739 --> 00:02:02.269 line:12% align:center size:92%
Proof of Delivery is already
picked as the type.

27
00:02:02.269 --> 00:02:08.928 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap Scan Document to use the camera,
or Upload File for a saved photo.

28
00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:14.309 line:12% align:center size:92%
Then tap Upload.
Dispatch needs it to close out the load.

29
00:02:14.309 --> 00:02:18.111 line:12% align:center size:92%
Now Delivered is ready when you finish.

30
00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:23.160 line:12% align:center size:92%
Log fuel, tolls and repairs under
the load, in Expenses.

31
00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.414 line:12% align:center size:92%
Add a photo of the receipt.

32
00:02:26.414 --> 00:02:33.272 line:12% align:center size:92%
Enter the amount, and for fuel,
the gallons.

33
00:02:33.272 --> 00:02:37.378 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap Submit Expense.
It's filed under this load.

34
00:02:37.378 --> 00:02:42.030 line:12% align:center size:92%
You can add receipts until
7 days after delivery.

35
00:02:42.124 --> 00:02:45.379 line:12% align:center size:92%
Alerts shows updates about your loads.

36
00:02:45.379 --> 00:02:48.294 line:12% align:center size:92%
Messages go straight to dispatch.

37
00:02:48.294 --> 00:02:54.836 line:12% align:center size:92%
Type a note and tap send.

38
00:02:54.932 --> 00:02:59.038 line:12% align:center size:92%
Your Kit keeps your papers in one place.

39
00:02:59.038 --> 00:03:05.143 line:12% align:center size:92%
Truck papers for inspections, your CDL,
and the contracts you signed.

40
00:03:05.229 --> 00:03:09.335 line:12% align:center size:92%
Invoices is where you send
your weekly invoice.

41
00:03:09.335 --> 00:03:12.589 line:12% align:center size:92%
Pick the week with the arrows.

42
00:03:12.589 --> 00:03:17.119 line:12% align:center size:92%
Tap Generate Weekly Invoice by Friday,
6:30 PM Eastern.

43
00:03:17.119 --> 00:03:23.326 line:12% align:center size:92%
Past invoices are listed below.
Tap one to open its PDF.

44
00:03:23.423 --> 00:03:29.866 line:12% align:center size:92%
Remember: your status updates itself,
upload your POD, log your receipts,

45
00:03:29.866 --> 00:03:32.547 line:12% align:center size:92%
and message dispatch.
